theorem epochMars (Y:Supplier)(L M:ℝ)(u:0<M)(z:ℕ→ℕ):∃ (P:Spine)(K:P.Register), uniform P K Y L M∧ P.Roster ∧ GeometrySharp P.par ∧ (∃ (G:Pitching.Focus.Morn P.par.K)(M:Pitching.Focus.Morn P.par.K)(Aα qv ε:ℝ)(Q:Diary), M={G with cap:=max (requests G) (Fintype.card Ξθ),Mult:=M.Mult}∧ Fees G (4*Swell.Yρ G.coinP G.φ 1) ≤ Aα ∧Καlendar P.par.R M.armor qv Aα M.Mult ε∧minAir G (4*Swell.Yρ G.coinP G.φ 1) Aα≤ P.par.R.L.val∧ 4*(Aα+1)≤ M.Mult∧ M.After P.par.R∧ Q.fits P.par.R ∧ ShelfTh M Q P.par.R0 P.par.δ P.par.C P.par.J Chi.canonical P.par.h P.par.P P.par.N0 P.par.delay ∧ Reader P M Aα) ∧
      ∃ (c r:ℕ→ℕ)(x:P.Spectrum0 3), z≤r∧∃ J:P.Ellis 3 x, Experiment P K c r x J ∧ Transmission P x c r∧
        ∃ (s n:ℕ)(a:ℝ)(F G: SampleDose), F.Normalized ∧ G.Normalized ∧ tsupport F.val⊆reviewEarlierBox.invites∧tsupport G.val⊆reviewLaterBox.invites ∧ P.ReturnsSix x s n a F G∧P.FixedSatinReadings K x s n a F G:=by
 let κ0 (K:Teller SU.group)(G:Pitching.Focus.Morn K):ℝ:=4*Swell.Yρ G.coinP G.φ 1
 obtain ⟨P,K,r,h,tK,k,p⟩:=resolutionSharp (fun K G=>Fees G (κ0 K G)) (fun _ G =>requests G) (fun K G _ A _=>minAir G (κ0 K G) A) Y L M u z
 obtain ⟨G,Q,T,A,t0,t1,l,v,Y0,d,w,e,q0,o,WQ⟩:=k.serves
 obtain ⟨j,g,c,s⟩:= horizon2 G T l A (κ0 P.par.K G) t0 t1 w v P.par.R.L d
 have he: κ0 P.par.K T ≤ A:=by
    rw [l]; exact (le_trans ((le_max_right ..).trans ((le_max_left ..).trans (le_max_left ..))) v)
 refine ⟨P,K,r,h,tK,⟨G,T,A,t0,t1,Q,l,v,w,d,g,e,q0,o,?_⟩,p⟩
